        "name": "Rune Prison",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Ryze traps a target in a cage of runes, damaging them and slowing their movement. If the target has Flux on it, they are instead rooted.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ryze deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power) + (3% bonus Mana)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 50% for 1.5 seconds. If the target has <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Flux</span>, it is consumed and this Ability <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> instead of <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span>.",
