        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Passively, Overload deals even more damage against targets with Flux.<br><br>On cast, Ryze creates a portal to a nearby location. After a few seconds, allies standing near the portal are teleported to the target location.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> <span>Overload</span> damage bonus against targets with <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Flux</span> increased to 50/75/100%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Ryze opens a portal to another location. After 2 seconds, all allies near the portal are teleported to that location.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">If Ryze becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilized</span> or <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disabled</span>, the portal is cancelled.</span>",
